##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
Display "array_red_green.tiff" "file" "rgb"
Format 160 80 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 35

Translate 0 0 8

WorldBegin

    Translate -1.1 0 0
    Surface "array_red_green" "uniform float selectedIndex" [0]
    Sphere 1 -1 1 360

    Translate 2.2 0 0
    Surface "array_red_green" "uniform float selectedIndex" [1]
    Sphere 1 -1 1 360

WorldEnd
